WEBVTT

00:06:29.583 --> 00:06:33.059
or what it does to their brains
or their sexuality.

00:06:33.083 --> 00:06:35.559
Here's what I have to report back.

00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:39.518
The free, online, mainstream pornography,

00:06:39.542 --> 00:06:42.143
that's the kind that teenagers
are most likely to see,

00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:46.351
is a completely terrible form
of sex education.

00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:51.809
(Laughter)

00:06:51.833 --> 00:06:56.143
(Applause)

00:06:56.167 --> 00:06:59.583
But that's not what it was intended for.